%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 843e26ab636f0e343ab5caf370b9b5f6, type: 3}
  m_Name: Pekros
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Actor
  scenes:
  - dialogueName: Introduction
    replacedByAnimation: 0
    conditions: []
    sentences:
    - id: 0
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 860305b1e70a65c42982c7b0e2182a3e, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: I told you, I don't need you here
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 0
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 01000000
    - id: 1
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 860305b1e70a65c42982c7b0e2182a3e, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: I swear, this time! This time it works! I just tested it! if you can
        just give me a chance to-
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 02000000
    - id: 2
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 860305b1e70a65c42982c7b0e2182a3e, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Boy, I had enough of you and your little trinkets! This is the last time!
        If I see you in my shop again, by the towers and above, I will cut you finer
        than my ground meat! Now, Out!
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 0
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 03000000
    - id: 3
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: UGH!... Hey! You didn't have to throw me ou-
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 04000000
    - id: 4
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Ha... Just my luck... The knife had to catch fire at just the RIGHT time!
        DAMN IT!
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 050000000600000007000000
    - id: 4
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Are you okay?
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 08000000
    - id: 5
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: The man always this loud?
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 0c000000
    - id: 6
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: A knife caught fire?
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 11000000
    - id: 8
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc0b1664b3651974a832ec5f50116a4f, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Are you okay? That fall must have hurt badly.
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 0
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 09000000
    - id: 9
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Wha- me? Nah, I'm good. Physically
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 0a000000
    - id: 10
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Don't worry, it is not my first time going through something like this.
        At this point, I might call it physical training. Hahaha...
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 0b000000
    - id: 11
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: But thank you. Seems to me at least one person is KIND ENOUGH TO CARE!!
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 18000000
    - id: 12
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc0b1664b3651974a832ec5f50116a4f, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Ugh, was he loud... is he always screaming?
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 0
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 0d000000
    - id: 13
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Hah! If only you knew! He thinks the only way to sell his roasted beef
        is by screaming louder than a sirene. It is impressive that he can still
        scream this much when he does it daily.
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 0e000000
    - id: 14
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: But sadly, he has it out for me specifically.
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 0f000000
    - id: 15
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc0b1664b3651974a832ec5f50116a4f, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Hahaha! Can't believe you haven't gone deaf.
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 0
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 10000000
    - id: 16
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Oh, I did! I just got so used to it at this point
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 18000000
    - id: 17
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc0b1664b3651974a832ec5f50116a4f, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: A knife caught on fire exactly how?
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 0
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 12000000
    - id: 18
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: You! Are you mocking me?
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 13000000
    - id: 19
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc0b1664b3651974a832ec5f50116a4f, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: What? No! I'm curious how a knife catches fire! It would be helpful inside
        the tower
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 0
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 14000000
    - id: 20
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: 'The tower? You a Climber?  '
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 15000000
    - id: 21
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc0b1664b3651974a832ec5f50116a4f, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: What? I don't look the part?
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 0
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 16000000
    - id: 22
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: 'Climbers aren''t exactly interested in my inventions... They say it
        just isn''t suited for it. '
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 17000000
    - id: 23
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc0b1664b3651974a832ec5f50116a4f, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: That just means they haven't seen its usecase yet.
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 0
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 18000000
    - id: 24
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Huh... You seem alright. What is your name?
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 19000000
    - id: 25
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc0b1664b3651974a832ec5f50116a4f, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Myne, and you?
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 0
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 1a000000
    - id: 26
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: I am Pekros! Pekros, the Artificer!
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 1b000000
    - id: 27
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc0b1664b3651974a832ec5f50116a4f, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Oh we are using our dream title? I am Myne, the Spire-Top Seeker.
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 0
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 1c000000
    - id: 28
      actor: {fileID: 11400000}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Dream ti-ugh... But aren't you too young to be a Climber?
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 1
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 1d000000
    - id: 29
      actor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fc0b1664b3651974a832ec5f50116a4f, type: 2}
      audio: {fileID: 0}
      text: Aren't you too young to be an artificer?
      actorSprite: {fileID: 0}
      leftImage: 0
      bonus: 0
      choiceBranchIDs: 
  fillerScenes: []
  actorName: Pekros
  currentProgress: 0
  defaultSprite: {fileID: 0}
